ting it ([b2eb15c](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/b2eb15c8839093de94bfbc6b7f10cdfb02a50f3b))\n* **ci:** harden release and analysis inputs ([cf4bdea](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/cf4bdea6defb767b4ac016e0c1e7819505f6a745))\n* **ci:** refresh AppHost package audit ([f914752](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/f914752cf8223b683799d4b25b4b0f742863297b))\n* **ci:** refresh workspace test package audit ([01f52f1](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/01f52f146c869b6b5605df8a83166babd7b96d5c))\n* **ci:** reject a green exit when the trx summary or counters failed ([cad9252](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/cad925260713718895282c69bcbdb8bc72e7b6a2))\n* **ci:** restore the Release graph before Release builds ([6952b59](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/6952b59c3486ee50d32056c3fee07a07e8120bd5))\n* **evidence:** archive captured package catalogs ([aac713a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/aac713a2f189ec9563c899a2220c8da6d74ef237))\n* **evidence:** archive captured package catalogs ([#139](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/139)) ([b547fc1](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/b547fc1f0d7455f69bdb6bd5047ed4154f77afe6))\n* **runtime:** complete local run retention and cleanup rules ([b215213](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/b215213da90f7a25f7a181f8d4b394226148ac59))\n* **runtime:** harden local run retention and cleanup ([7116b16](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/7116b1672c58fda4f480ed77c9898bfec34622c9))\n* **test:** accept latest patch roll-forward for the pinned SDK ([05ae0a2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/05ae0a23adfb516231b31da6d83989bdf229f2f9))\n* **tooling:** align active fixtures with EventStore 3.128.0 ([f9142d8](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/f9142d8a845a16e54ee060e6a0250c773d00e0ba))\n* **tooling:** align active fixtures with EventStore 3.128.0 ([#141](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/issues/141)) ([db897ea](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/db897eac9f2819220b32d237109d7255218b46a9))\n* **tooling:** align fixtures with EventStore 3.128.3 ([03e8620](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/03e8620eed027e86e18c0744d5df4f046461db4c))\n* **tooling:** close story 2.5 lifecycle review findings ([0902fd6](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/0902fd6c527750ee3fc6832824f42b5b9bfdcfa6))\n* **workflows:** enforce approved release execution gates ([568417a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/568417aebb4f517e9f46d9c60f8564b0d8f7503f))\n* **workspace:** canonicalize retained source-mapping properties ([334e905](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/334e905afca1e9887b2325d47a8419beb5945e8f))\n"}